<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <p xml:id="Aink155-kilavi">
        palavaḻiyāṉum vāyilnērāḷākiya talaimakaḷ makappēṟṟiṟku urittākiya kālaṅkaḻiya oḻukukiṉṟāy eṉa neruṅkiyatōḻikkuc colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
         Spoken by the heroine who refused entry [to the hero] in many ways, to [her] close confidante, saying 'you are behaving as though the time appropriate for childbirth has [already] passed.'
  </p>
</div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink155">
<l>veḷḷāṅ kurukiṉ piḷḷai cetteṉak</l>
<l>kāṇiya ceṉṟa maṭanaṭai nārai</l>
<l>pataippat tatainta neytal kaḻiya</l>
<l>vōtamoṭu peyarun tuṟaivaṟkup</l>
<l>paiñcāyp pāvai yīṉṟaṉeṉ yāṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
       <l> I [already] produced a doll [made of] Paiñcāy grass</l>
       <l>For the man of the ghat in which the Neytal [flower]</l>
       <l>That was rubbed -so that it throbbed/fluttered - </l>
       <l>By the wader with an inexperienced walk</l>
       <l>That went to see, since the hatchling of the white wader died -</l>
        <l>Moved along with the flood of backwaters.</l>
              </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
